From 7cf65d5fc428d3f308104ea871383603c523a91d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuri <wyyu9420@163.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:04:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(memory): remove keyword gate and add contextual recall
 injection

Recall on every non-empty user turn instead of only fixed trigger words,
collect up to four same-conversation user messages to resolve anaphora, and
distinguish permission/network/timeout failures without leaking request text.
Evidence is bounded (profile + items) and injected into the current message
only; recall/delivery telemetry is reported without blocking the model.
